This package is a Deterministic Narrative Machine (DNM):  
it takes a narrative seed, applies a fixed LaTeX template, and produces a story with no randomness.

## Files

- `universe_machine.hson` — machine specification
- `seed.txt` — narrative seed text
- `machine.tex` — LaTeX story template
- `run_hson.py` — deterministic engine
- `story_output.tex` — generated output (created on run)

## How to run

```bash
python run_hson.py

This will generate story_output.tex containing the narrative, deterministically derived from seed.txt and machine.tex.

